.. here the power percentage of Legendary Cat Shield's (maximum +50% Initial Health) activated by these Treasures is:

( (1*1) + (2*2) + (0*3) ) / (3*3) = 55.55% or +27.77% Initial Health. (as shown but rounded down in-game)

In this example a level 1 [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] with Initial Health of 100 would be treasure boosted by 55% of +50% Health.

The level 1 Cat's new health is now 127.

There are three Empire of Cats chapters each containing Legendary Cat Shield so the effect of obtaining each of those three sets at maximum power gives 100%, 200% or 300% [Legendary Cat Shield power, that would increase the Initial Health of [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] to 150, 200 or 250 at level 1. (an increase of +50%, +100% or +150%)

All cats have their own initial Health (HP) and Attack (AP) Stats.

