What these examples show is how powerful the Legendary Cat Shield and Legendary Cat Sword Treasure bonuses are on a cat's health and Attack Power and why it's important to obtain them.

In both of these cases and all others, it shows that any level 1 Cat with the maximum 300% Treasure boost is ''stronger'' than the same cat at level 8 with 0% Treasure boost.

